   so light / dark follow the site; the blue tick keeps its own blue.
   DISCORD-STYLE LAYOUT (owner, 2026-11-18): no bubbles — avatar left, coloured name + role badge + time, plain text below; consecutive messages
   of one member within 5 min are grouped (.chx-cont, set by chat.js); hover toolbar on desktop; reply connector line above a reply. Every rule starts with html:root:root (the theme generator leaves it alone). */
